{"title":"악덕의 저지먼트","artist":"mothy","sourceId":"reference:fNz4UGG86fWtUuXBviqb","sourceHash":"9e501d6d70d5b093cdf812229ef6eda865ba8b2014b9a60444a1e2213b6f1595","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":32.7,"end":34.16,"text":"汚された司法","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":34.16,"end":37.16,"text":"被告の貧富で決まる罪状","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":39.62,"end":41.23,"text":"法廷の主たる(master of the court)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":41.23,"end":44.23,"text":"私が望むのは正義より金","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.15,"end":49.15,"text":"極悪人でも金さえ払えば救ってやるさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":53.1,"end":56.1,"text":"地獄の沙汰も金次第","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":60.21,"end":63.21,"text":"容姿や年齢 人種や性別","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":63.44,"end":66.44,"text":"全て関係ない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":66.9,"end":69.9,"text":"大切なことは金が払えるか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":70.44,"end":73.44,"text":"ただそれだけだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":73.72,"end":76.72,"text":"お前の人生は私次第","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":77.38,"end":80.38,"text":"救いがほしけりゃ金を出せ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":80.82,"end":83.82,"text":"そう罪は私のさじ加減ひとつ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":84.24,"end":87.24,"text":"悪徳のジャッジメント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":87.53,"end":90.53,"text":"冤罪の沼からスクわれたいならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":91.34,"end":94.34,"text":"もっとお金を渡しなさい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":97.92,"end":100.92,"text":"足の不自由な娘の為にも金が必要","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":104.84,"end":107.84,"text":"大罪の器 七つが揃えば願いは叶う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":111.58,"end":114.58,"text":"今日も繰り広げられる疑惑の法廷","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":114.6,"end":117.6,"text":"悪人が笑い善人が泣く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":118.39,"end":121.39,"text":"そう罪は私のさじ加減一つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":121.89,"end":124.89,"text":"悪徳のジャッジメント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":125.35,"end":128.35,"text":"自らの悲願を叶えるためならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":128.54,"end":131.54,"text":"非道の槌を振るい続ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":142.8,"end":145.8,"text":"民衆殺しの悪辣将軍 死罪が当然","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":149.24,"end":151.11,"text":"渡された賄賂","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":151.11,"end":154.11,"text":"私は被告に無罪を告げた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":156.3,"end":159.3,"text":"巻き起こる怒り 始まった内戦","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":159.55,"end":162.55,"text":"殺された将軍","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":162.72,"end":165.72,"text":"無残な死体 野にさらす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":170.03,"end":173.03,"text":"怒りの矛先 私へと向かい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":173.15,"end":176.15,"text":"燃え盛る家 愛しい「娘」よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":176.69,"end":179.69,"text":"二人一緒なら恐怖などない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":183.45,"end":186.45,"text":"焼け落ちた屋敷から見つかるだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":186.88,"end":189.88,"text":"孤独な「親子」の亡骸が...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":205.65,"end":208.65,"text":"目が覚めた時に一人いた場所は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":209.34,"end":212.34,"text":"冥界の門 天国か地獄か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":214.2,"end":216.09,"text":"それを決めるのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":216.09,"end":219.09,"text":"冥界の主(master of the hellish yard)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":219.56,"end":222.56,"text":"極悪人でも金さえ払えば救ってやるさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":226.14,"end":229.14,"text":"地獄の沙汰も金次第","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":233.61,"end":234.94,"text":"私は微笑み","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":234.94,"end":237.94,"text":"冥界の主にそっと耳打ち","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":239.96,"end":242.96,"text":"「私の財産 貴様なんぞには決して渡さない」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":246.65,"end":249.65,"text":"扉に飛び込んだこの身体","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":250.45,"end":253.45,"text":"地獄の底へ落ちて行く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":253.91,"end":256.90999999999997,"text":"そう罪は私のさじ加減ひとつ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":257.06,"end":260.06,"text":"悪徳のジャッジメント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":260.51,"end":263.51,"text":"たとえ誰だろうと私のこの罪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":264.3,"end":267.3,"text":"裁くことは認めない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":267.76,"end":270.76,"text":"そういつか再びこの手に集めよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":270.99,"end":273.99,"text":"大罪のフラグメント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":274.47,"end":277.47,"text":"その時に地獄は私と娘の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":277.93,"end":280.93,"text":"理想郷へと変わるだろう...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}